    "body": "The Phase 2 core (M.V.G. critical path): recursive/spherical k-means or medoid/density variants over compiler-side representations + teacher distributions from the observation pipeline; candidate partitions scored by predictive entropy reduction, neighbor preservation, bootstrap stability, probe cost, artifact bytes (PDF §22); calibrated overlapping membership (masks+radii, top-M, nearest-class fallback floor retained); parent/child refinement edges and lateral neighbor edges from co-activation; explicit overlap nodes only with held-out gain; reference classifier frozen as normative semantics with routing recall measured against it. Depends on the observation pipeline v2 issue. Gate C comparison harness runs graph vs TLA3 baseline at exit.",
